0..55 Comment "//! Recursive calls can nest under constructor results."
56..59 Comment "//!"
60..118 Comment "//! The elaborator expands `S(S(dbl[<](x)))` into a `run`."
119..170 Comment "//! The constructors then receive the call\'s value."
